tor.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": " Asking and Responding to Suggestions", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You can use modals and a variety of expressions to make suggestions or respond to suggestions.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Bob</span>: Shall we go to Valencia? <br/> <span class=\"strong\">Nate</span>: OK.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "You can use the words<span class=\"strong\"> should</span>, <span class=\"strong\">shall</span>,<span class=\"strong\"> let's</span>,<span class=\"strong\"> I suggest</span> and <span class=\"strong\">how about</span> to make suggestions.  <br/>You can respond to suggestions in the positive or negative.<br/><br/> <span class=\"strong\"> Positive</span> <br/>Yes, I'd like to. <br/>OK.<br/> Yes, let's.<br/> Yes, I'd love to. <br/>Yes, that's a great idea! <br/> <br/><br/> <span class=\"strong\"> Negative</span> <br/>   No, let's not. <br/>No, I don't think so. <br/> I'd rather not. <br/>I don't feel like it.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":6,\"columns\":2,\